🧩 Concepts Used
Concept	How it is used
Dictionary {}	Stores item names and quantities
Key-value pairs	Item name is the key; quantity is the value
input()	Gets item names and quantities
int()	Converts quantities and menu choices into integers
.title()	Formats item names
in	Checks whether an item exists
if / else	Controls inventory operations
+=	Increases stock
-=	Decreases stock
for loop	Iterates through inventory
enumerate()	Displays numbered inventory items
found_low	Tracks whether low-stock items were found
<	Checks whether quantity is below 5
while True	Repeats the menu
break	Exits the program


